# The mise release Puddle downloads into a workspace: `<version> <release asset> <sha256>`, one line per
# guest architecture. The first line's version is the one used; `puddle-agent mise-fetch` refuses a
# download that does not match the line for its architecture. The values are the lines of
# `https://mise.jdx.dev/v<version>/SHASUMS256.txt` and `https://github.com/jdx/mise/releases/download/v<version>/SHASUMS256.txt`;
# `ci/check-mise-pin.sh` checks both against this file every night.
